I go to the large glass counter.
I still have my backpack on my shoulder.
A waiter stands behind the counter.
He is currently cleaning something.
I wait for a moment.
I look at the selection.
There are many cakes here.
I also see sweet pastries.
Everything looks very delicious.
What do I want to eat today?
An apple cake is surely good.
But then I see something else.
There stands a large chocolate cake.
It looks simply wonderful.
It is very dark.
I love chocolate.
That is perfect against the cold outside.
I will take a piece of chocolate cake.
The waiter now comes to me.
